+/* Irreversible executable containment, separate from document retirement.
+   Owner thread, outside engine/native entry after unwind; requires scope
+   tracking enabled and refuses tracked active entry without changing state.
+   No allocation, finalizers, queue changes, or interruption reset. Contexts,
+   values and data identity remain retained. Does not certify native safety.
+   Marking blocks native functions from that context as well as author code;
+   unknown custom call classes and wrapper chains beyond the guard bound
+   refuse locally once any context is marked. Wrapper recovery stays disabled. */
